": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1DPjlQQk1ToQ7kNvwGD8O2k&_nc_oc=AdruqchNrKf52jwqLED0lCBl_LWEr3Nuq0wLKPgCodXa6NF0ZY3_pGHerVjUeZUoi-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLc4VWv5Fx1KQfv02Eu6BGdzoq_q73AX83B0Wr2dETWw&oe=6AEF4C9B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cl3hbKHtQ2UQ7kNvwGwYJxz&_nc_oc=AdqWcdI4gXStlN0NmwgpfUuR_6n-JJJapM0Hgqtn1jZHQ6cja4DSMeXCDbNn3SgabXw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4Oi6ytrx0EHqd-Jj4ClMXTWok-_SexKZgPewJX-7EKQ&oe=6AEF3CE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x-7b3U0ukbgQ7kNvwEguiXT&_nc_oc=Adpj4CPQbbypo9SMunIszIK2bx0nWoP6ynYLYf1wg7-RVo9ed-1lqBE8A_73Aky6Wcw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHlmHxFFF-6xmtoLKvJDEuhMcMpqoca8OoZ8_UrSLyAA&oe=6AEF61EF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XD7b4n82w1YQ7kNvwGjxQs2&_nc_oc=AdoPamSmNFwJVq_Y2hCxTUUS4lUXfhBOc8pyEOInsYAEI-5bD_GGgjtE-ZfuK3WjGRI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSdaOte8qEnUwEeUqQCTdIsbMqgUdCRl17UbKatJkHkgQ&oe=6AEF6192"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X4hBFX4SSUkQ7kNvwF0mK1-&_nc_oc=AdpKN68LSRU9mMW06zfe_U8p-DnYINL2k4Iq5wOzEyCRxMWnbAl_zchmBktDAuTkw8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRnITJRUJYEm9ym9_qt-7aTFAlu93ts_REjTygbNUpfZg&oe=6AEF32FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a